# Auto-build after fix series (InPmnt)

When you finish a **connected set of changes** that fix or materially affect **runtime, billing, packaging, or start scripts**, do **not** end the turn until you have:

1. Smoke-checked the app (`python -c` import / test_client, or `.\start.ps1` briefly).
2. Rebuilt zips: `powershell -File .\build_release.ps1` (or `python3 build_release.py`).
3. Published those zips as **GitHub Release** assets (tag `vX.Y.Z`) so they are downloadable at `https://github.com/devildog5x5/InPmnt/releases/download/vX.Y.Z/...`.
4. Given **### New build links** using those verified GitHub URLs (not only local `installers\` paths).
5. Committed and pushed when the change set is shippable (per release SOP).
